    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the New Continent of Elodya!</h2> Arriving in a boat from the western continent, you and your crew have been tasked with exploring and learning about the habitants, wildlife, materials and secrets of the undiscovered continent of Elodya!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Materials and Craft Gear!</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/63f1749f1cbb450802f7c0fd9269c452.poster.avif?t=1737674526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/63f1749f1cbb450802f7c0fd9269c452.webm?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/63f1749f1cbb450802f7c0fd9269c452.mp4?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gather materials to craft gear and complete quests! Upgrade your camp to unlock more crafting recipes, equip more things and much more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Diverse Creatures and Bosses!</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/707e4c7f639ee85334ad1b9714f439a2.poster.avif?t=1737674526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/707e4c7f639ee85334ad1b9714f439a2.webm?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/707e4c7f639ee85334ad1b9714f439a2.mp4?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight tough souls-like enemies by using diverse weapons! Craft and equip armors and accessories to defeat bosses and progress through the game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Interesting Characters!</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/0f46a7d8928f8c6f56ef4feb41045b39.poster.avif?t=1737674526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/0f46a7d8928f8c6f56ef4feb41045b39.webm?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/0f46a7d8928f8c6f56ef4feb41045b39.mp4?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build relationships with the inhabitants of Elodya! Upgrade your village with new houses to attract more villagers!",
