" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/0f46a7d8928f8c6f56ef4feb41045b39.poster.avif?t=1737674526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/0f46a7d8928f8c6f56ef4feb41045b39.webm?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323780/extras/0f46a7d8928f8c6f56ef4feb41045b39.mp4?t=1737674526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build relationships with the inhabitants of Elodya! Upgrade your village with new houses to attract more villagers!",
